{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1414139-how-do-incarnate-scions-work","id":1414139,"title":"How do \"Incarnate\" Scions work?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-09-16T23:43:14-07:00","id":1414139,"title":"How do \"Incarnate\" Scions work?","content":"I'll be starting a new round on saturday and one of my players wants to play an Incarnate Scion of Sun Wukong.<br /> <br /> Would that mean that:<br /> <br /> a) Sun Wukong is dead, she is the rest of one of his mantles that doesn't (her descision) remember being a god once and got reborn as a Scion?<br /> a1) If so, does she have a different divine parent or where do her godly powers hail from? If her divine parents is still Sun Wukong a.k.a herself, does that mean she gets another kind of visitation than Born scions?<br /> b) She is actually the Mantle of some other dead god and Sun Wukong adopted her and thus gave her his powers?<br /> c) She is the incarnation of one of Sun Wukongs dead mantles that now acts as if it was a Scion of its own self?<br /> d) Something else entirely?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26156,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26156-avalontzi","user":"AvalonTzi","date":".  Another idea came up. 09-17-2020, 02:54 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26156-avalontzi","name":"AvalonTzi","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-17T00:35:41-07:00","id":1414147,"title":"","content":"Any and all, it is up to you and the GM. The power can come from the former self, the visitation can be from a former servant or dreaming of former self. You can tell the GM what is your idea and maybe get some help.<br /> <br /> Another option is:<br /> Sun Wukong wake up certain morning wanting to have a life again. Took a part of self and impregnated a woman or placed into a fetus. When the kid grow they learn they are an Avatar of Sun Wukong, but it don\u2019t mean that Sun Wukon is dead, or missing a part, maybe Sun Wokun is just looking for a new part, new mantle or new legend.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-17T00:45:03-07:00","id":1414148,"title":"","content":"So Incarnates are kind of weird, but the thing is Incarnates are among other possibilities a god choosing to have part of themselves born as a mortal for the purposes of things like recreating myths, handling duties they can't as a god, or just getting experience stuff on the mortal level. Example part of Vishnu's shtick as it were is Incarnating when the world is in danger to solve the problem and save the world from said perils.<br /> <br /> Consequently it is possible to be an incarnation of Sun Wukong without anything having happened to the Monkey King aside from boredom. Now it is possible something happened to Sun Wukong as well and there it can get weird. A god can have a number of incarnations running about doing stuff and if the mantle is severed or the god is killed then the present Incarnations just become Scions of the old deity without any further fuss. Amusingly with recent stuff on how Demigods becoming gods works it may also be possible for a god to die, currently active Incarnates to become Scions, and yet the god is running around like nothing really happened.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-17T01:05:31-07:00","id":1414152,"title":"","content":"Thanks to the both of you. I think I can let my player be pretty happy with those answers as we'll just figure out what's up with the monkey king together <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26156-avalontzi","name":"AvalonTzi","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-17T03:36:17-07:00","id":1414163,"title":"","content":"From <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/scion-demigod-book-3-for-the-scion-second-edition-rpg/description\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Demigod</b> book Kickstarter preview</a>, totally possible is that Incarnate Scion is created by half-finished god Mantle of the demigod that tried to overcome present version of God. So in your example, now Sun Wukong had rival demigod that wanted to be another version of Monkey King, as another Mantle. Demigod failed his Apotheosis Journey ( i.e. got dead ) and now half-finished Mantle of this over version of Sun Wukong is roaming around the World. Mantle, itself, chosen new body for it, creating Incarnated Scion of demigod Mantle, to finally creating new Monkey King God - even if previous is all good and fine.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 09-17-2020, 06:51 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-17T05:03:05-07:00","id":1414177,"title":"","content":"Sun Wukong may want to add a modern version of himself and creates a Incarnation to become Son Goku.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-17T20:53:37-07:00","id":1414326,"title":"","content":"With Sun Wukong specifically he could have just... plucked a hair and put some more oomph into it than usual.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}